WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:20.390
Last time: every statement is true or false

3
00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:31.450
Chapter 2 · AND, OR, NOT

4
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:40.310
Tiny words → big decisions

5
00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:45.150
Let's go to a birthday party!

6
00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:55.900
Robo guards the door at Anaya's party

7
00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:08.150
Rule: bring cake AND juice

8
00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:17.910
Arjun brings cake… but no juice

9
00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:26.060
Can Arjun come in? Think!

10
00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:38.400
No! AND needs both. Juice is missing.

11
00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:47.890
Cake AND juice → Yes, come in!

12
00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:53.430
AND = both must be true

13
00:01:53.430 --> 00:02:08.020
Both → Yes. Anything less → No.

14
00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:17.910
AND is fussy. One missing → No!

15
00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:28.630
Gift AND card. Kabir has only a gift.

16
00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:36.340
No. AND needs both, the card is missing

17
00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:44.660
Fun fair rule: a ticket OR a pass

18
00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:54.480
OR = at least one must be true

19
00:02:54.480 --> 00:03:04.830
Both? Still YES! Both is fine too.

20
00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:11.160
Neither → No

21
00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:18.360
Sara has only a pass. Can she enter?

22
00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:26.570
Yes! For OR, one is enough

23
00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:32.810
NOT = the opposite. It flips it!

24
00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:41.300
NOT true = false · NOT false = true

25
00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:56.270
Rule: NOT wearing muddy shoes

26
00:03:56.270 --> 00:04:04.610
Clean shoes → not muddy → Aman goes in

27
00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:12.140
Games use AND and OR to decide

28
00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:20.490
Key AND torch → open the cave (if-both)

29
00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:29.200
Coin OR gem → get a point (if-either)

30
00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:34.880
Checked many times every second!

31
00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:53.780
Key AND torch. Who can open the cave?

32
00:04:53.780 --> 00:05:05.350
Only Zoya has both the key and the torch

33
00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:22.700
Juice OR sweets, AND NOT late. Pooja?

34
00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:31.950
Part 1: juice OR sweets → true

35
00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:39.250
Part 2: NOT late → true

36
00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:47.920
True AND true → Yes, Pooja comes in!

37
00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:51.800
Your turn: practice check

38
00:05:51.800 --> 00:06:04.560
Hat AND ticket. You have only a ticket.

39
00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:15.800
No! AND needs both. Grab a hat!

40
00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:21.560
AND → both must be true

41
00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:26.740
OR → at least one is true

42
00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:31.580
NOT → flip it to the opposite

43
00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:36.270
Games use if-both and if-either

44
00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:41.420
Chapter 2 done!

45
00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:48.220
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
